<title>TAIWAN: First Int'l plans T$4.02/share dividend.</title>
<headline>First Int'l plans T$4.02/share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Internatonal Computer Inc, Taiwan's second largest computer firm, said on Wednesday it plans a stock dividend, or bonus issue, of T$4.02 per share for 1996.</p>
<p>The proposal needs approval by its shareholders in a meeting slated for June 6, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
